WEBVTT

01:38.240 --> 01:41.060
[The Demon Hunter's Romance]

01:41.100 --> 01:43.960
[Episode 15]

01:48.560 --> 01:49.200
Not here.

01:49.590 --> 01:50.720
Go check over there.

01:51.280 --> 01:51.840
That way.

01:56.840 --> 01:57.700
She's not here.

01:58.479 --> 01:59.410
Look over there.

02:06.870 --> 02:07.400
Here.

02:08.520 --> 02:09.320
What's wrong?

02:09.870 --> 02:11.710
There are many puppets in the yard.

02:11.710 --> 02:12.970
They didn't notice me.

02:13.520 --> 02:14.280
Don't go out.

02:25.120 --> 02:26.050
You're all here.

02:29.079 --> 02:30.610
Constable Li, can you walk?

02:30.800 --> 02:31.430
Yes.

02:32.770 --> 02:33.829
We can't stay here.

02:34.120 --> 02:35.240
Feng Wuniang has escaped.

02:35.240 --> 02:36.970
Let's go down the mountain now.

02:39.870 --> 02:40.750
Be careful.

02:59.240 --> 03:00.520
The innkeeper is missing.

03:00.520 --> 03:01.180
Put it down.

03:04.780 --> 03:06.310
I'll go back to look for him.

03:06.710 --> 03:07.510
Don't bother.

03:09.970 --> 03:11.300
He's Wuniang's father.

03:11.630 --> 03:13.630
She won't hurt him.

03:18.470 --> 03:19.270
What's wrong?

03:20.220 --> 03:21.380
Am I wrong?

03:23.079 --> 03:23.630
Let's go.

03:24.000 --> 03:24.680
No.

03:25.690 --> 03:26.579
You're right.

03:36.079 --> 03:36.800
Banxia,

03:37.890 --> 03:38.910
I drew a self-protection seal

03:38.910 --> 03:40.120
on your palm.

03:40.960 --> 03:41.760
Why is it gone?

03:47.120 --> 03:48.180
Go ahead, you guys.

03:53.840 --> 03:54.470
Wuniang!

03:55.960 --> 03:56.630
Wuniang!

03:58.850 --> 03:59.450
Wuniang!

04:02.430 --> 04:03.220
Wuniang!

04:07.560 --> 04:08.190
Wuniang.

04:09.310 --> 04:10.000
Wuniang.

04:13.030 --> 04:13.680
Wuniang!

04:15.630 --> 04:16.310
Wuniang.

04:17.829 --> 04:18.310
Wu…

04:32.220 --> 04:32.900
Wuniang.

04:55.010 --> 04:55.690
Did you

04:56.390 --> 04:57.920
kill that guy?

04:58.870 --> 04:59.430
No.

04:59.920 --> 05:01.160
Why do you look like

05:01.160 --> 05:02.800
you wish I had killed him?

05:03.630 --> 05:04.120
Fine.

05:04.560 --> 05:05.830
I'll kill someone

05:06.240 --> 05:07.560
to fulfill your wish!

05:08.680 --> 05:09.310
Father.

05:09.920 --> 05:11.190
Do you know me at all?

05:46.920 --> 05:47.510
Father.

05:48.800 --> 05:50.400
You found it out eventually.

05:53.190 --> 05:53.920
You are…

05:55.830 --> 05:57.120
It's me, Father.

05:59.430 --> 06:00.760
Can't you recognize me?

06:02.120 --> 06:03.980
I've become prettier, haven't I?

06:05.310 --> 06:07.910
After collecting body parts for so many years,

06:08.000 --> 06:08.770
I finally got

06:08.790 --> 06:10.040
a perfect body.

06:10.800 --> 06:12.360
That has not been easy.

06:19.270 --> 06:20.920
Why did you break it?

06:34.730 --> 06:36.540
Let me show you more clearly.

06:40.159 --> 06:41.100
Why did you

06:41.120 --> 06:43.590
kill so many people?

06:46.120 --> 06:47.450
What's wrong with that?

06:48.159 --> 06:49.890
They were all innocent people!

06:50.159 --> 06:50.720
I…

06:53.159 --> 06:54.760
Are you going to hit me again?

06:57.340 --> 06:58.700
I'm the innocent one.

07:00.430 --> 07:02.040
You created me,

07:02.360 --> 07:04.040
but you don't like me.

07:05.600 --> 07:06.360
There's revulsion in your eyes

07:06.360 --> 07:07.920
when you look at me.

07:08.430 --> 07:09.240
Do you hate me?

07:10.390 --> 07:12.630
Do you hate me for keeping you from going home?

07:12.630 --> 07:13.390
Wuniang.

07:15.330 --> 07:16.520
I've kept you here

07:17.000 --> 07:18.870
to protect you.

07:19.560 --> 07:20.480
I don't want you

07:20.510 --> 07:21.950
to be judged by others.

07:22.950 --> 07:25.070
I want you to live a happy life.

07:27.680 --> 07:28.510
Do you really

07:28.510 --> 07:29.750
want me happy?

07:32.680 --> 07:34.870
You keep telling everyone that I'm sick

07:34.870 --> 07:36.070
and have bad manners.

07:36.600 --> 07:38.360
You never approved of me.

07:40.480 --> 07:42.159
I can be better.

07:43.070 --> 07:44.390
I have so many eyes,

07:44.870 --> 07:46.270
noses, and mouths.

07:47.680 --> 07:48.560
But why?

07:49.390 --> 07:50.190
Why can I never

07:50.190 --> 07:50.870
piece together

07:50.870 --> 07:52.420
the kind of daughter you want?

07:52.420 --> 07:53.030
Dear,

07:54.870 --> 07:56.310
let me get you out of here.

07:56.870 --> 07:58.470
You can go wherever you want.

07:58.600 --> 08:00.510
In the future, I'll let you

08:01.270 --> 08:02.470
do whatever you want.

08:04.680 --> 08:06.360
Just don't hurt anyone again.

08:07.120 --> 08:07.750
Okay?

08:16.070 --> 08:17.600
You're no longer my father.

08:19.750 --> 08:21.310
From now on, we have nothing

08:21.310 --> 08:22.510
to do with each other.

08:23.280 --> 08:25.090
I'm going to find my own life.

08:43.740 --> 08:44.340
Banxia.

08:45.510 --> 08:46.190
Banxia.

08:52.980 --> 08:53.580
Banxia.

09:19.750 --> 09:20.750
Xuanye, I'm here.

09:21.360 --> 09:22.000
Xuanye.

09:23.080 --> 09:24.210
She stole my sheath.

09:25.390 --> 09:25.910
You turned

09:25.910 --> 09:27.120
into me first.

09:28.080 --> 09:29.340
She's the fake one.

09:29.670 --> 09:30.360
She's so cunning.

09:30.360 --> 09:31.420
Don't believe her.

09:31.920 --> 09:32.510
Xuanye.

10:00.960 --> 10:02.670
You made the wrong choice.

10:03.530 --> 10:06.290
I'm much better than her.

10:07.270 --> 10:08.420
You stupid woman.

10:10.960 --> 10:12.630
Only you had to die,

10:12.630 --> 10:14.560
but you wouldn't stop struggling.

10:14.630 --> 10:15.390
Now,

10:16.390 --> 10:17.920
both of you have to die here.

10:18.840 --> 10:20.150
Don't be so sure.

10:20.870 --> 10:21.950
We don't know

10:22.240 --> 10:23.570
who will die here today.

10:24.200 --> 10:25.160
Mr. Jiu.

10:27.120 --> 10:28.720
I don't want to be hard on you.

10:30.090 --> 10:30.760
I even think

10:30.780 --> 10:32.460
we're a good match.

10:33.330 --> 10:34.570
You're handsome,

10:35.490 --> 10:36.650
and I'm pretty.

10:37.200 --> 10:37.930
Why don't you

10:38.710 --> 10:40.110
give it a second thought?

10:44.550 --> 10:45.630
What is real?

10:46.440 --> 10:47.480
What is fake?

10:49.410 --> 10:51.340
Let me accompany you on her behalf.

10:52.390 --> 10:53.920
I can do everything she can.

10:54.790 --> 10:55.750
If one day,

10:56.600 --> 10:58.000
you get sick of this face

10:58.750 --> 11:00.210
and get bored of this girl,

11:00.480 --> 11:01.480
I can change into another person

11:01.480 --> 11:02.120
for you.

11:02.440 --> 11:03.370
Isn't that good?

11:04.130 --> 11:05.530
Fake is fake.

11:06.080 --> 11:06.940
Stop dreaming.

11:13.870 --> 11:15.130
Since that's the case,

11:16.840 --> 11:18.090
why are you obsessed

11:18.110 --> 11:19.240
with the Fubai Wine?

11:23.910 --> 11:24.970
Are you surprised?

11:26.510 --> 11:27.720
I know everything

11:27.720 --> 11:29.320
that's happened in this inn.

11:30.030 --> 11:31.630
Good wine makes the drinker drunk quickly,

11:31.630 --> 11:34.040
but some people just can't stop drinking it.

11:34.040 --> 11:34.800
You knew

11:34.820 --> 11:36.300
it was all just an illusion

11:36.790 --> 11:37.630
but still wouldn't let go

11:37.630 --> 11:38.750
of that warmth.

11:40.200 --> 11:41.000
Mr. Jiu.

11:41.830 --> 11:43.190
Which is better,

11:43.550 --> 11:44.750
reality or illusion?

11:45.970 --> 11:47.580
What you want is simple.

11:47.670 --> 11:48.730
I can give it to you.

11:49.200 --> 11:49.870
All I want

11:50.670 --> 11:51.670
is a home too.

11:52.390 --> 11:54.000
I can be your family.

11:54.380 --> 11:55.200
Isn't that much better

11:55.200 --> 11:56.510
than the Fubai Wine?

11:58.490 --> 12:00.320
Family can never be replaced.

12:00.910 --> 12:02.570
Fake things can never be real.

12:03.240 --> 12:04.390
You don't know

12:04.390 --> 12:05.590
what family is at all.

12:07.910 --> 12:08.480
Wuniang,

12:09.270 --> 12:10.390
your body is fake,

12:10.600 --> 12:12.060
and your heart is vicious.

12:12.230 --> 12:14.320
You can only be a monster your whole life!

12:14.320 --> 12:15.000
Shut up!

12:16.790 --> 12:18.080
Once you die,

12:19.420 --> 12:20.470
I'll be real!

13:24.040 --> 13:24.950
What is real?

13:25.150 --> 13:26.280
I'll answer you now.

13:26.790 --> 13:27.670
For you,

13:28.200 --> 13:29.030
the pretty body

13:29.030 --> 13:30.890
my sword pierced through is fake.

13:31.270 --> 13:32.270
Inside this body,

13:32.330 --> 13:33.450
that rotten

13:33.480 --> 13:34.480
and twisted heart

13:34.510 --> 13:35.320
is real.

13:36.130 --> 13:37.370
You talk too much.

13:38.190 --> 13:39.830
Today, I'll use your blood

13:40.240 --> 13:41.640
to celebrate my rebirth!

15:00.440 --> 15:01.320
Fire!

16:15.200 --> 16:16.630
Why are you helping her?

16:17.270 --> 16:18.360
She's my daughter!

16:19.270 --> 16:21.080
Please don't hurt her.

16:37.790 --> 16:38.720
Please.

16:39.550 --> 16:40.680
Let me take her away.

16:42.810 --> 16:44.900
Don't hurt her, will you?

16:55.870 --> 16:56.670
Thank you.

17:06.099 --> 17:06.750
Dear,

17:08.400 --> 17:09.589
it's all my fault.

17:10.180 --> 17:11.240
You're right.

17:12.589 --> 17:13.869
I shouldn't have

17:13.900 --> 17:15.230
kept you here all alone.

17:16.550 --> 17:18.510
I should've taken you home.

17:19.720 --> 17:20.640
I was wrong.

17:21.510 --> 17:22.440
I was wrong.

17:23.920 --> 17:25.510
Can you forgive me?

17:32.430 --> 17:33.830
I'll take you home now

17:34.440 --> 17:36.450
to visit your grandparents,

17:36.920 --> 17:38.160
uncles, and aunts.

17:38.960 --> 17:41.390
We'll plant orange trees,

17:41.570 --> 17:43.750
and you can have a big yellow dog.

17:45.440 --> 17:46.970
I'll stay with you forever.

17:49.480 --> 17:50.070
Okay?

17:51.720 --> 17:52.270
Okay.

17:54.110 --> 17:54.680
Father.

17:57.440 --> 17:59.440
My dream will finally come true.

18:00.440 --> 18:00.960
Yes.

18:01.480 --> 18:02.000
Yes.

18:03.770 --> 18:05.770
All I need to do now is get rid of them.

18:12.270 --> 18:14.920
You can't kill anyone anymore!

18:29.200 --> 18:29.960
Dear,

18:31.830 --> 18:34.400
you can't kill anyone anymore.

18:35.920 --> 18:37.440
You lied to me.

18:57.070 --> 18:57.750
Wuniang!

18:59.240 --> 19:00.500
I'll keep you company!

19:24.030 --> 19:25.920
Why did you stop me?

19:26.350 --> 19:27.910
Why did you stop me?

19:35.920 --> 19:36.590
Wuniang.

19:37.730 --> 19:38.990
I'll keep you company.

19:39.550 --> 19:40.810
I'll keep you company.

19:43.750 --> 19:44.510
Wuniang.

20:31.880 --> 20:33.350
What is Nine Lives doing?

20:33.960 --> 20:35.620
Is he trying to save Feng Tian?

20:36.510 --> 20:37.270
This should be

20:37.270 --> 20:38.920
Nine Lives' last life.

20:40.830 --> 20:42.190
Is it worth it?

20:50.970 --> 20:52.470
In order to save Feng Tian,

20:52.550 --> 20:54.680
the Cat Demon sacrificed his own life.

20:55.110 --> 20:55.880
Maybe

20:56.590 --> 20:58.050
he thought it was worth it.

21:36.170 --> 21:36.930
Where am I?

21:38.960 --> 21:39.830
I didn't die?

21:48.270 --> 21:49.000
It's because

21:49.510 --> 21:50.910
he didn't want you to die.

21:54.890 --> 21:55.700
In this world,

21:56.510 --> 21:58.880
some people think they're insignificant

21:59.160 --> 22:00.820
and pity themselves for that.

22:00.880 --> 22:02.140
But they don't realize

22:02.400 --> 22:04.460
that someone who truly cares for them

22:04.720 --> 22:05.980
will give up their life

22:06.150 --> 22:07.440
to keep them safe.

22:09.070 --> 22:09.880
Why?

22:12.820 --> 22:14.260
Some creatures

22:15.310 --> 22:18.020
will spend their whole life repaying someone's kindness

22:18.020 --> 22:19.330
and even die for it.

22:31.310 --> 22:32.420
I remember now.

22:34.160 --> 22:35.070
We were suffering

22:35.070 --> 22:36.730
from a great plague that year.

22:37.480 --> 22:38.830
My sheep died.

22:39.880 --> 22:41.880
There was no food left in Guima Fort.

22:42.590 --> 22:44.880
I was so hungry that day.

22:58.960 --> 23:00.360
Why are you looking at me?

23:01.360 --> 23:02.160
Stop looking.

23:05.520 --> 23:07.250
Stop looking at me.

23:10.720 --> 23:11.720
I didn't eat it.

23:12.510 --> 23:13.310
Maybe because

23:13.310 --> 23:15.070
I thought that cat was too thin

23:15.160 --> 23:17.590
and eating it wouldn't last me for too long.

23:18.310 --> 23:19.350
That's the last piece

23:19.350 --> 23:21.160
of ham I have left.

23:22.950 --> 23:24.080
I've given you half.

23:25.600 --> 23:26.460
Take your time.

23:27.240 --> 23:28.000
Enjoy it.

23:31.160 --> 23:32.820
On the other side of the desert

23:33.000 --> 23:34.200
is the Central Plain.

23:34.830 --> 23:36.030
My home is there.

23:38.840 --> 23:40.170
I wonder

23:40.200 --> 23:41.600
how my parents are doing.

23:42.510 --> 23:43.910
I hope they've been good.

23:52.270 --> 23:53.440
Little kitten,

23:54.640 --> 23:56.300
I think you can understand me.

23:56.720 --> 23:57.900
With you here,

23:59.000 --> 24:00.440
I'm not alone.

24:02.240 --> 24:03.110
How about I

24:03.110 --> 24:03.970
give you a name?

24:04.550 --> 24:05.550
I'll call you…

24:07.400 --> 24:09.160
Nine Lives.

24:10.590 --> 24:11.250
Nine Lives.

24:12.440 --> 24:13.160
Nine Lives!

24:15.680 --> 24:16.550
At first,

24:17.750 --> 24:20.030
we were together all the time.

24:21.390 --> 24:22.590
Then one day,

24:23.610 --> 24:25.060
a strange man showed up.

24:27.060 --> 24:28.720
Seeing that I lived all alone,

24:29.460 --> 24:30.670
he pitied me

24:32.160 --> 24:33.440
and taught me

24:33.920 --> 24:35.640
how to make puppets.

24:36.890 --> 24:39.810
Then I made Wuniang and Qingshan.

24:40.550 --> 24:41.790
One day,

24:42.650 --> 24:44.020
I suddenly found

24:44.470 --> 24:46.670
that they developed minds of their own.

24:48.650 --> 24:49.730
It's like

24:51.220 --> 24:52.820
they had become real humans.

24:56.110 --> 24:57.390
After that,

24:58.930 --> 25:00.580
I never saw Nine Lives again.

25:02.150 --> 25:03.070
I thought...

25:04.150 --> 25:05.830
I thought he left.

25:06.530 --> 25:07.460
He didn't leave.

25:08.260 --> 25:08.930
He was always

25:08.930 --> 25:10.010
by your side.

25:10.850 --> 25:11.760
It's just that your attention

25:11.760 --> 25:13.310
was somewhere else,

25:13.680 --> 25:15.010
so you couldn't see him.

25:29.720 --> 25:30.880
You came back here

25:31.160 --> 25:32.240
and built this inn.

25:33.000 --> 25:34.200
He followed you back.

25:34.830 --> 25:36.110
He wanted to get close to you,

25:36.110 --> 25:37.640
but Wuniang drove him away.

25:38.440 --> 25:39.640
Having nowhere to go,

25:39.780 --> 25:41.310
he went to hide in the woods.

25:41.310 --> 25:43.160
Although he later got primordial spirit

25:43.160 --> 25:44.490
and became self-aware,

25:44.750 --> 25:47.070
he didn't get to transform into human shape.

25:47.070 --> 25:48.070
He couldn't talk,

25:48.550 --> 25:50.680
so he was unable to tell you what happened.

25:50.680 --> 25:52.590
Seeing you so depressed,

25:52.960 --> 25:54.160
he wanted to help you,

25:54.440 --> 25:56.570
so he caused a stir by selling his lives

25:57.200 --> 25:58.860
and drew us to the Reunion Inn.

25:59.350 --> 25:59.960
His goal

26:00.510 --> 26:01.590
was to get us

26:01.680 --> 26:03.140
to take you away from here.

26:04.310 --> 26:05.370
Selling his lives?

26:05.640 --> 26:06.630
He was a Cat Demon

26:07.030 --> 26:08.160
and had nine lives.

26:12.110 --> 26:13.070
Then why…

26:13.690 --> 26:15.170
A lot has happened.

26:16.110 --> 26:17.110
He used them up.

26:18.160 --> 26:19.290
He gave his last life

26:19.680 --> 26:20.820
to you.

26:29.480 --> 26:31.000
He sacrificed his lives

26:31.550 --> 26:32.400
to lure us here

26:33.500 --> 26:34.430
so that you could leave

26:34.430 --> 26:35.360
the Reunion Inn.

26:36.750 --> 26:37.480
So,

26:38.560 --> 26:39.440
don't let all his efforts

26:39.440 --> 26:40.630
be in vain.

26:45.590 --> 26:47.070
The Reunion Inn.

26:50.110 --> 26:51.070
I thought

26:54.000 --> 26:55.110
we'd stay here

26:55.110 --> 26:56.510
for the rest of our lives.

26:57.640 --> 26:59.750
I thought I gave Wuniang

27:00.480 --> 27:02.680
and Qingshan a home.

27:04.310 --> 27:05.680
But this place…

27:07.760 --> 27:08.830
actually became

27:08.860 --> 27:10.620
a cage for us.

27:11.680 --> 27:13.110
I didn't want to accept

27:13.440 --> 27:16.790
the fact that Wuniang had changed.

27:19.880 --> 27:23.070
It's my fault that it ended up like this.

27:31.350 --> 27:32.240
Mr. Feng Tian,

27:33.160 --> 27:34.750
Nine Lives wished

27:35.090 --> 27:37.290
that you could pull yourself together.

27:37.660 --> 27:39.140
He never forgot

27:39.400 --> 27:40.870
your kindness to him.

27:42.110 --> 27:43.370
It's not wrong to love,

27:44.070 --> 27:46.130
but you shouldn't let love blind you.

28:03.350 --> 28:04.000
Xuanye,

28:04.510 --> 28:06.000
when did you know

28:06.000 --> 28:07.920
there were other demons

28:07.920 --> 28:09.420
in the inn besides the Cat Demon?

28:09.420 --> 28:11.220
When you gave me the wooden bead.

28:11.720 --> 28:12.550
I saw something strange

28:12.550 --> 28:14.000
in the pool.

28:32.110 --> 28:33.880
You found it out so early.

28:34.680 --> 28:37.080
So you planned ahead,

28:37.310 --> 28:39.000
secretly contacted Youhuang

28:39.030 --> 28:40.070
and Nive Lives,

28:40.640 --> 28:41.930
and then let me help you

28:42.160 --> 28:44.620
lure Wuniang into exposing herself, right?

28:45.400 --> 28:45.950
Banxia,

28:47.270 --> 28:48.400
I need to appear weak

28:49.110 --> 28:50.350
to lure the demon out.

28:50.850 --> 28:51.500
Thank you.

28:52.270 --> 28:53.530
You're good at acting.

28:53.560 --> 28:54.650
I wasn't acting.

28:54.680 --> 28:55.810
I was really scared.

28:57.890 --> 28:58.700
How did you

28:58.720 --> 28:59.870
convince Yanqiu?

29:00.790 --> 29:02.150
Actually, the Fubai Wine

29:02.150 --> 29:04.400
won't make the drinker completely delirious.

29:04.400 --> 29:06.200
As long as you have a strong mind,

29:06.390 --> 29:08.910
you can still tell reality from illusion.

29:10.130 --> 29:11.900
Your cousin was wallowing in grief

29:11.900 --> 29:13.030
and wouldn't move on

29:13.320 --> 29:14.040
because

29:14.070 --> 29:15.160
there was nothing more important

29:15.160 --> 29:16.000
to buck him up.

29:26.030 --> 29:28.480
Banxia is in danger. Help us.

29:32.660 --> 29:34.230
I see.

29:36.000 --> 29:37.250
Wuniang said

29:37.400 --> 29:39.200
you didn't drink the Fubai Wine.

29:39.270 --> 29:40.760
So you lied to her?

29:42.680 --> 29:43.640
You said

29:43.790 --> 29:45.450
you drank that wine every day.

29:45.480 --> 29:47.010
It was also a lie, wasn't it?

29:49.350 --> 29:50.920
All right. The rain has stopped.

29:50.920 --> 29:52.780
Let's go to that Hoto noodle shop.

29:52.920 --> 29:53.480
Let's go.

30:03.240 --> 30:03.960
Thank you.

30:13.320 --> 30:24.350
[Wu's Hoto Noodles]

30:26.960 --> 30:27.620
Here we are.

30:32.400 --> 30:33.260
Physician Jiu.

30:33.550 --> 30:34.330
Please come in.

30:34.330 --> 30:34.860
Welcome.

30:36.270 --> 30:37.000
Physician Jiu.

30:37.000 --> 30:38.860
What would you like to have today?

30:38.980 --> 30:41.350
Two bowls of Hoto noodles, one plate of stuffed lotus root with sticky rice,

30:41.350 --> 30:42.510
one plate of perilla,

30:42.510 --> 30:43.880
one plate of burdock root,

30:43.880 --> 30:46.010
and two plates of spicy pickled melon.

30:46.480 --> 30:48.140
Would you like anything else?

30:49.000 --> 30:50.440
No. That's quite a lot.

30:51.270 --> 30:52.160
That's all.

30:52.480 --> 30:54.160
We're hungry. Please hurry.

30:54.440 --> 30:54.920
Okay.

30:55.680 --> 30:56.540
Physician Jiu,

30:57.160 --> 30:58.550
this is the first time

30:58.790 --> 31:00.990
you've brought a girl to my restaurant.

31:02.640 --> 31:03.310
Miss,

31:03.920 --> 31:04.880
how old are you?

31:05.200 --> 31:06.260
Where are you from?

31:08.030 --> 31:09.720
I'm from Nanyang.

31:09.720 --> 31:11.180
I just moved to Guangping.

31:11.790 --> 31:12.850
So you're new here.

31:12.880 --> 31:13.880
Where do you live?

31:14.270 --> 31:15.880
I live on Sifang Street.

31:15.880 --> 31:17.640
The house on the south end.

31:18.590 --> 31:19.070
That…

31:19.790 --> 31:22.110
That's next to Ganshan Clinic.

31:25.440 --> 31:25.960
Miss,

31:26.440 --> 31:27.510
are you engaged?

31:28.000 --> 31:28.640
Mr. Wu.

31:29.350 --> 31:30.480
Go prepare the food.

31:31.810 --> 31:32.610
Wait a moment.

31:38.000 --> 31:40.200
You're quite familiar with him.

31:40.550 --> 31:41.810
Do you come here often?

31:43.400 --> 31:44.730
I treated his wife once.

31:44.790 --> 31:46.920
We've known each other for a long time.

31:52.690 --> 31:54.360
Here, have some water.

31:59.400 --> 32:01.790
So what is that?

32:04.350 --> 32:06.550
It's a magic tool for self-protection.

32:07.750 --> 32:08.960
A magic tool?

32:09.380 --> 32:10.440
It can keep me safe.

32:13.350 --> 32:14.680
Is it related to demons?

32:16.270 --> 32:17.800
My dad didn't mention that.

32:20.960 --> 32:22.920
Won't your sleeve

32:23.310 --> 32:24.510
wipe it off?

32:26.920 --> 32:28.960
It's a tattoo. It can't be wiped off.

32:35.960 --> 32:37.560
Here come your Hoto noodles.

32:41.880 --> 32:42.880
That's a big portion.

32:42.880 --> 32:43.550
Big?

32:43.960 --> 32:45.310
We've been selling noodles here for a long time.

32:45.310 --> 32:46.640
They're very delicious.

32:46.640 --> 32:47.290
Maybe

32:47.380 --> 32:48.540
you'll ask for more.

32:50.560 --> 32:51.770
What is this?

32:52.200 --> 32:54.030
We didn't order it.

32:54.550 --> 32:55.510
This is the honey cake.

32:55.510 --> 32:56.570
A gift from my boss.

32:56.640 --> 32:58.070
He said the honey cake

32:58.110 --> 32:59.310
is made with honey and sesame oil.

32:59.310 --> 33:00.110
It carries a lovely meaning.

33:00.110 --> 33:01.070
After eating it,

33:01.270 --> 33:02.920
you'll surely stay together forever

33:02.920 --> 33:04.250
and be as sweet as honey.

33:04.400 --> 33:05.200
Please enjoy.

33:09.640 --> 33:10.770
Don't listen to him.

33:11.470 --> 33:12.230
Try it.

33:19.960 --> 33:21.720
Do you want to try it?

33:24.720 --> 33:25.240
Okay.

33:48.790 --> 33:49.580
Do you know

33:49.720 --> 33:51.880
how my dad found Nine Lives?

33:53.780 --> 33:55.270
I guess

33:55.300 --> 33:56.560
he found Chi Wangchuan

33:57.010 --> 33:57.810
and happened

33:57.920 --> 34:00.240
to hear that Nine Lives was selling his lives.

34:00.240 --> 34:01.590
So he planned to use Nine Lives

34:01.590 --> 34:03.120
to get rid of Chi Wangchuan.

34:04.670 --> 34:06.090
But Chi Wangchuan

34:06.120 --> 34:07.180
found out his plan.

34:09.320 --> 34:10.070
Don't worry.

34:10.760 --> 34:12.280
We'll find more clues.

34:13.150 --> 34:15.210
With you helping me, I'm not worried.

34:21.360 --> 34:22.159
What's wrong?

34:22.760 --> 34:24.880
I stepped in a puddle just now.

34:25.190 --> 34:26.590
My socks got wet.

34:30.880 --> 34:31.780
I can carry you.

34:34.400 --> 34:36.170
Thanks, but I can walk myself.

34:37.300 --> 34:38.630
You must be tired from the long journey.

34:38.630 --> 34:40.550
Let me carry you.

34:53.800 --> 34:54.510
Xuanye,

34:55.550 --> 34:57.070
do you like to drink?

34:57.840 --> 34:59.520
If you do,

34:59.590 --> 35:00.450
I'll make

35:00.480 --> 35:02.210
refreshing fruit wine for you.

35:02.280 --> 35:03.880
It won't give you a headache.

35:05.360 --> 35:06.000
Okay.

35:07.320 --> 35:08.660
Then it's a deal.

35:09.050 --> 35:10.450
When you want a drink,

35:10.480 --> 35:11.230
come to me.

35:11.480 --> 35:12.900
Don't drink alone.

35:24.760 --> 35:26.240
You ate a lot tonight.

35:26.620 --> 35:27.650
Don't go to bed too early.

35:27.650 --> 35:29.110
You may have indigestion.

35:30.630 --> 35:31.320
Xuanye,

35:31.760 --> 35:32.410
can you

35:32.430 --> 35:34.100
draw another seal for me?

35:35.440 --> 35:37.400
I need it to feel secure.

35:39.920 --> 35:42.590
That self-protection seal is for saving your life.

35:42.590 --> 35:43.440
If you use it too often,

35:43.440 --> 35:44.840
it'll drain your energy.

35:45.550 --> 35:46.230
So,

35:46.640 --> 35:48.510
unless it's absolutely necessary,

35:48.510 --> 35:49.570
you must not use it.

35:49.770 --> 35:50.500
Understand?

35:51.670 --> 35:52.360
Yes.

35:52.760 --> 35:53.840
I was very careful

35:53.840 --> 35:54.970
every time I used it.

36:05.070 --> 36:05.670
It's done.

36:08.000 --> 36:09.480
Why are your hands so cold?

36:10.360 --> 36:11.690
Are you feeling unwell?

36:14.990 --> 36:15.700
No.

36:17.030 --> 36:18.470
It rained just now.

36:18.590 --> 36:19.840
It'll be cold at night.

36:19.840 --> 36:20.630
Find yourself

36:20.630 --> 36:21.670
a thick blanket.

36:34.570 --> 36:35.420
I will.

36:52.360 --> 36:53.320
I'll go back now.

37:05.920 --> 37:07.760
Why is there grey hair again?

37:26.440 --> 37:27.030
Xuanye.

37:27.580 --> 37:29.780
Why didn't you go eat after coming back?

37:31.870 --> 37:32.720
Did you practice martial arts

37:32.720 --> 37:34.580
until midnight last night again?

37:35.030 --> 37:36.960
I didn't sleep well because of the noise you made.

37:36.960 --> 37:39.220
I even dreamed of fighting with someone.

37:47.960 --> 37:48.510
Xuanye,

37:48.840 --> 37:49.400
trust me.

37:50.850 --> 37:52.230
Feed the Moon Bugs with sheep lung soup

37:52.230 --> 37:52.960
every month,

37:53.550 --> 37:55.750
and they'll grow big and plump for sure.

37:55.880 --> 37:56.880
Even a 1000-year-old demon

37:56.880 --> 37:58.140
can be daunted by them.

37:59.920 --> 38:01.670
Xuanye, come and play cards with us.

38:01.670 --> 38:02.600
Come on, Xuanye.

38:02.840 --> 38:04.570
You always have the winning hand. No one wants to play with you.

38:04.570 --> 38:06.150
What a sore loser. We can play again!

38:06.150 --> 38:07.150
Let's play again.

38:17.760 --> 38:18.440
You brat.

38:18.800 --> 38:20.200
All you know is drinking.

38:20.400 --> 38:23.060
Have you mastered the Bahuang Fist I taught you?

38:23.670 --> 38:25.070
I knew you'd forget it.

38:30.000 --> 38:31.290
Let me teach you again.

38:31.590 --> 38:32.590
Watch carefully.

38:33.050 --> 38:35.930
♫A familiar figure♫

38:36.410 --> 38:39.520
♫Becomes clear in the haze♫

38:40.050 --> 38:44.480
♫Yet it's out of reach♫

38:46.900 --> 38:49.880
♫Your earnest reminders♫

38:50.400 --> 38:53.230
♫And words of concern♫

38:53.980 --> 39:00.130
♫They've woven and colored the time we shared♫

39:00.880 --> 39:03.900
♫Traces of bond♫

39:04.370 --> 39:07.380
♫With a sigh, we bid farewell♫

39:07.860 --> 39:13.380
♫Keeping you company, and seeing you off on a long journey♫

39:14.530 --> 39:17.680
♫You're the same as before♫

39:18.170 --> 39:21.630
♫And I'm still following closely behind♫

39:21.800 --> 39:27.400
♫Remember it day and night♫

39:28.270 --> 39:30.050
♫One side is the past♫

39:30.080 --> 39:34.380
♫Where you lingered♫

39:35.130 --> 39:36.880
♫The other is the unforgettable♫

39:36.910 --> 39:40.880
♫Dream of mine♫

39:39.160 --> 39:41.480
[Memorial Tablet of My Brother, Jiu Xi]

39:42.110 --> 39:45.600
[Memorial Tablet of My Father, Jiu Cangming]

39:42.110 --> 39:45.600
[Memorial Tablet of My Mother, Hong Ning]

39:42.190 --> 39:45.290
♫A fallen leaf, a drop of wine♫

39:45.650 --> 39:48.400
♫Each drop into my heart♫

39:49.170 --> 39:54.570
♫A moment of memory, an illusion♫

39:55.680 --> 40:01.340
♫A segment of reminiscence engraved for a lifetime♫

40:22.150 --> 40:22.670
Xuanye.

40:23.190 --> 40:24.440
Xuanye, are you home?

40:27.280 --> 40:27.960
Xuanye.

40:28.610 --> 40:29.340
Xuanye.

40:33.400 --> 40:35.000
I knew you'd come back today.

40:36.000 --> 40:36.920
Where did you go?

40:36.920 --> 40:38.130
I went to Wen Jian's place.

40:38.130 --> 40:39.060
His wife

40:39.090 --> 40:40.340
is so bad at cooking.

40:40.590 --> 40:41.720
I didn't eat enough.

40:42.800 --> 40:44.800
You can't be picky about free meals.

40:44.990 --> 40:46.250
Xuanye, give me money.

40:46.320 --> 40:47.580
I want to buy radishes.

40:49.030 --> 40:49.790
I don't have money.

40:49.790 --> 40:50.590
You're lying.

40:50.800 --> 40:51.580
The Cat Demon gave you

40:51.580 --> 40:52.720
a big box of silver.

40:52.800 --> 40:53.480
I saw it.

40:54.650 --> 40:55.500
You saw it?

40:56.070 --> 40:57.470
Then go find it yourself.

41:24.280 --> 41:25.550
So many checks.

41:27.630 --> 41:28.230
One,

41:28.920 --> 41:29.440
two,

41:29.880 --> 41:30.840
three, four,

41:31.590 --> 41:32.070
five.

41:33.480 --> 41:34.880
Seven, eight, nine.
